msgctxt "64"
msgid "Guh... Who the hell are you, anyway...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"We're underage, you know... I don't care if you're a yakuza or whatever. If "
"you screw with us... you know what'll happen?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"I can guess. But I know Kamurocho cops aren't dumb enough to take your word "
"for it. Learned that myself a long time ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"You guys gotta keep it down. Look what you've done to my poor widdle "
"henchmen!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "...So you're their leader?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "And what if I am?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "Get out of the Dragon Palace. Now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Sorry? The Dragon's what?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"The building you've made your hideout. You're going to get out of there, "
"now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "And who's gonna make me, buddy? You don't look like a cop to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"I'm not in the mood for negotiations. This is an order, so I suggest you "
"listen up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Heheh... hahahahaha! Oh man, you're hilarious!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"I gotta hand it to you... In all my 19 years, you're the first guy to "
"lecture me to my face like this! You think you're my babysitter?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"I'm used to taking care of kids, yeah. Except mine are a lot smarter than "
"you guys."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"Well, I guess I don't mind giving up a shithole like that place... long as "
"you got a replacement in mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "There's no room in Kamurocho for you punks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "Oooh, that's some pretty big talk... Okay, then. Let's play a game."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "What kind of game?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"See, at first, I just kicked the hobos around cause I was in a bad mood. "
"Didn't have to be them. Anyone would be fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"But once we started smackin' around the ones in that building, we got used "
"to it. Now even that's gotten old."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "Cut the monologue. I asked you a question."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid ""
"Right, this game... Basically, all I wanna do is hit someone. Anyone. So how"
" about I hit you instead?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "Oh, but you can hit me back, of course!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "So that's it. You're just looking for a fight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid ""
"Hey, don't underestimate me. I'm stronger than I look! If you win, you get "
"our little hangout, fair and square. Sound good?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "Fine. So it's a one-on-one fight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"Whoa there, old man! You're pretty into this, huh? Well, don't blame me if I"
" accidentally kill ya!"
msgstr ""

